{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kLkybDXIFg1793589427.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有分析預期，港股短期處於上落市格局。</p><p></p><p>獨立股評人熊麗萍說：「過去幾日見到有資金流入一些傳統的股份，所以我相信恒生指數近期都回落至22,800點，但這些位置較為大的支持。除非再進一步外圍有任何壞消息，否則的話今年低位暫時未需要再試，但上面都是受限於在較早的時間，有一個較大的裂口位，是23,600點的水平。看是否會在這800點左右上落。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:21:11.355967+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T03:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T21:18:16.624577+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:18:49.583714+00:00","content_hash":"77b8b0a0233b2dc3a2a7e357d97c3912657aa87bfc9514aa89df4a5d2484a2be","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:21:11.355967+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}